{"id":"rbewtepo4d7pi62z8vwdofjsi","title":"弹性以太坊：重新思考以太坊的扩容、可用性和最终性","originalTitle":"Elastic Ethereum","summary":"以太坊目前的扩容能力是预先配置的，缺乏根据实际资源压力调整容量限制的机制。作者提出通过控制以太坊在最终性前的构建程度和降低构建风险来实现弹性扩容。当前，以太坊的平均区块在0.38秒内达到95%的节点，但仍有改进空间。弹性以太坊旨在通过动态调整来提高系统的鲁棒性和资源利用效率。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Ethereum Research"},"links":{"original":"https://ethresear.ch/t/elastic-ethereum/26236#post_1"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T11:40:49.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T12:27:48.704Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T12:27:48.704Z","category":"crypto-defi","tags":["研究报告","Ethereum"],"score":45,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"8d087741-1e9c-404b-b0c9-2b550398ac40","title":"以太坊弹性扩容提案引发技术讨论"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"@AfeRisT_D","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"8d087741-1e9c-404b-b0c9-2b550398ac40","title":"以太坊弹性扩容提案引发技术讨论"}],"topics":[{"slug":"ethereum","name":"以太坊 / ETH"},{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f3nVY5VlQ6cA","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}